#
# This example is C++ (the graph is the C++ half of espos_flow), so it takes
# the same Google style the component's own C++ carries rather than the
# 4-space C style of the root .clang-format.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
# Include order is deliberate: the component's own header first, then the
# espOS headers it depends on, then the system and IDF ones. Google's
# regrouping would move e.g. "espos_flow.h" below <cstdint>; never reorder.
SortIncludes: Never
